         "html": "<div><p>Free consultation • No upfront charge</p><h3>Custom logo design, delivered fast</h3><p>Work directly with professional designers to create a custom logo for your business. Fast concepts, multiple revisions, and high-resolution files, with no upfront payment.</p><ul><li>Same-day concepts for most projects</li><li>Multiple concepts & revisions included</li><li>High-resolution & vector files (AI, SVG, PNG, PDF)</li><li>You keep full ownership of your logo</li></ul><div>Prefer to talk? <a href=\"tel:+15127829748\">(512) 782-9748</a></div></div>",
