    },
    {
     "t": "accordion",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "Is the consultation really free?",
       "a": "<p>Yes. The consultation is free and there is no obligation to order. For logo design you also pay nothing until you approve the final design.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Can I send you a logo I made with AI?",
       "a": "<p>Yes. Upload it with the form or send it by text or WhatsApp. A designer will tell you what needs fixing and whether a cleanup or a new design makes more sense. Learn more on our <a href=\"/fix-ai-generated-logo/\">AI logo cleanup page</a>.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "Do I need to visit an office?",
       "a": "<p>No. Consultations and projects are handled by phone, text, WhatsApp and email, so you can work with us from anywhere in Austin or Central Texas.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "When are consultations available?",
       "a": "<p>Consultations are available seven days a week. Send a message any time and a designer will get back to you.</p>"
      },
      {
       "q": "How do I pay when the work is done?",
       "a": "<p>After you approve your design, you can pay by Cash App, Zelle, PayPal or bank deposit. We never ask for card numbers through the website or by text.</p>"
      }
     ],
     "classes": []
    }
   ]
